J.
Governmental Immunity.  The City of Cheyenne expressly reserves its rights to
invoke governmental immunity for any claim arising out of this Contract pursuant to the Wyoming
Governmental Claims Act, Wyo. Stat. § 1-39-101 et seq.
K.
Termination.  The City may  terminate this Contract for cause immediately without
notice or liability in the event CFD fails to perform.  Either party may terminate this Contract
without cause upon fifteen (15) days written notice, provided the terminating party pays the other
party for services rendered or expenses incurred by the other party prior to termination.
